## Command

```shell
biome format --write '<TEMP_DIR>/nested_gitignore_cannot_reinclude_file_below_ignored_parent/ignored/file.js' '<TEMP_DIR>/nested_gitignore_cannot_reinclude_file_below_ignored_parent/kept.js'
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "vcs": {
    "enabled": true,
    "clientKind": "git",
    "useIgnoreFile": true,
    "root": "."
  }
}
```

## `.gitignore`

```gitignore
ignored/

```

## `ignored/.gitignore`

```gitignore
!file.js

```

## `ignored/file.js`

```js
  statement(  )  
```

## `kept.js`

```js
statement();

```

